{"ID":"20240205164748-mgv8r2l","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205164748-mgv8r2l","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164748-mgv8r2l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206100645-mv94m52\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619172543-jzh7m35\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1102,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619172543-jzh7m35\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"金樱子","type":"doc","updated":"20240902175413"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206100645-mv94m52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206100645-mv94m52","updated":"20240206100653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于江西、重庆、湖南、湖北等地区。\n【性状】\t本品为花托发育而成的假果。呈倒卵形，表面红黄色或红棕色，有突起的棕色小点，系毛刺脱落后的残基。顶端有盘状花萼残基，中央有黄色柱基，下部渐尖。质硬。切开后，花托壁内有多数坚硬的小瘦果，内壁及瘦果均有淡黄色绒毛。气微，味甘，微涩。\n【性味】\t酸、甘、涩，平。\n【功效】\t固精缩尿，固崩止带，涩肠止泻。用于遗精滑精，遗尿尿频，崩漏带下，久泻久痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240206100646-v5vc0pi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206100646-v5vc0pi","updated":"20240206100646"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206100646-lts1945.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165246-qeey1xh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205165246-qeey1xh","updated":"20240205165246"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金樱子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金樱子-20240205165246-p8v6oyx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727134407-qs4ckf5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727134407-qs4ckf5","updated":"20240727134408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 559px;","style":"width: 549px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金樱子 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金樱子 5-20240727134158-dfh7r33.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 549px;\" parent-style=\"width: 559px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727133955-m6rx9as","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727133955-m6rx9as","updated":"20240727134335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 342px;","style":"width: 332px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金樱子 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金樱子 2-20240727134043-gb2ule2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 332px;\" parent-style=\"width: 342px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 319px;","style":"width: 309px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金樱子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金樱子-20240727133955-cv7azby.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 309px;\" parent-style=\"width: 319px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 619px;","style":"width: 609px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金樱子 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金樱子 7-20240727134335-7876gi8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 609px;\" parent-style=\"width: 619px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240619172543-jzh7m35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619172543-jzh7m35","updated":"20240727134243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 674px;","style":"width: 664px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金樱子 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金樱子 3-20240727134116-xyi999o.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 664px;\" parent-style=\"width: 674px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 628px;","style":"width: 618px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金樱子 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金樱子 6-20240727134243-hcoyq1z.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 618px;\" parent-style=\"width: 628px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240727134619-cj1wbjr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727134619-cj1wbjr","updated":"20240727135103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 837px;","style":"width: 827px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金樱子 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金樱子 12-20240727135032-927w6tq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 827px;\" parent-style=\"width: 837px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 320px;","style":"width: 310px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金樱子 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金樱子 4-20240727134143-sl04yff.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 310px;\" parent-style=\"width: 320px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 840px;","style":"width: 830px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金樱子 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金樱子 13-20240727135227-7g5j6e9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 830px;\" parent-style=\"width: 840px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 423px;","style":"width: 413px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金樱子 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金樱子 9-20240727134639-rkm5awz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 413px;\" parent-style=\"width: 423px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727134744-z6hec13","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727134744-z6hec13","updated":"20240727134943"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 348px;","style":"width: 338px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金樱子 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金樱子 10-20240727134859-rlkc5hu.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 338px;\" parent-style=\"width: 348px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 915px;","style":"width: 905px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金樱子 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金樱子 11-20240727134942-zas7uqg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 905px;\" parent-style=\"width: 915px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727135502-7a93at7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727135502-7a93at7","updated":"20240727135722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 638px;","style":"width: 628px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金樱子 (15)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金樱子 15-20240727135714-xnqqfrl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 628px;\" parent-style=\"width: 638px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 640px;","style":"width: 630px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金樱子 (14)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金樱子 14-20240727135502-ef2h9zp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 630px;\" parent-style=\"width: 640px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727134950-5zkfjuy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727134950-5zkfjuy","updated":"20240727135336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：金樱子不是树，而是攀援灌木；"}]},{"ID":"20240727135305-tpxojuj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240727135305-tpxojuj"}},{"ID":"20240902175406-dq693gq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-dq693gq","updated":"20240902175413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：金樱子"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-a81lo7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-a81lo7r","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"金樱子《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-191lryk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-191lryk","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】JīnYīnɡZǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-nvjve7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-nvjve7p","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】FRUCTUSROSAELAEVIGATAE"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-km08twi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-km08twi","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】糖罐子、刺头、倒挂金钩、黄茶瓶"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-0wtkhyk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-0wtkhyk","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为蔷薇科植物金樱子RosalaevigataMichx.的干燥成熟果实。10～11月果实成熟变红时采收，干燥，除去毛刺。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-8g6qig3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-8g6qig3","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品为花托发育而成的假果，呈倒卵形，长2～3.5cm，直径1～2cm。表面红黄色或红棕色，有突起的棕色小点，系毛刺脱落后的残基。顶端有盘状花萼残基，中央有黄色柱基，下部渐尖。质硬。切开后，花托壁厚1～2mm，内有多数坚硬的小瘦果，内壁及瘦果均有淡黄色绒毛。无臭，味甘、微涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-2maxpbf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-2maxpbf","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-6rcoyfu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-6rcoyfu","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）花托壁横切面：外表皮细胞类方形或略径向延长，外壁及侧壁增厚，角质化；表皮上的刺痕纵切面细胞径向延长。皮层薄壁细胞壁稍厚，纹孔明显，含油滴，并含橙黄色物，有的含草酸钙方晶及簇晶；纤维束散列于近皮层外侧；维管束多存在于皮层中部及内侧，外韧型，韧皮部外侧有纤维束，导管散在或呈放射状排列。内表皮细胞长方形，内壁增厚，角质化；有木化的非腺毛或其残基。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-irjych5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-irjych5","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"花托粉末淡肉红色。非腺毛单或多细胞，长505～1836μm，直径16～31μｍ，壁木化或微木化，表面常有略弯曲的斜条纹，胞腔内含黄棕色物。表皮细胞多角形，壁厚，内含黄棕色物。草酸钙方晶多见，长方形或不规则形，直径16～39μｍ；簇晶少见，直径27～66μｍ。螺纹、网纹、环纹及具缘纹孔导管直径8～20μm。薄壁细胞多角形，木化，具纹孔，含黄棕色物。纤维梭形或条形，黄色，长至1071μｍ，直径16～20μｍ，壁木化。树脂块不规则形，黄棕色，半透明。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-r6buzhc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-r6buzhc","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品粉末5g，加水50ml，置60℃水浴上加热15分钟，立即滤过。取滤液1ml,加碱性酒石酸铜试液4～5滴，在水浴中加热5分钟，生成红棕色沉淀；另取滤液1ml,加1％三氯化铁溶液1～2滴，即显暗紫色。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-o3g8ucd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-o3g8ucd","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）取（2）项下剩余的滤液2ml，置具塞试管中，用力振摇1分钟，产生大量蜂窝状泡沫，放置10分钟，泡沫无明显消失。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-rxxbhvi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-rxxbhvi","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-ta3a9t4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-ta3a9t4","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"金樱子：除去杂质，洗净，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-te6lpxg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-te6lpxg","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"金樱子肉：取净金樱子，略浸，润透，纵切两瓣，除去毛、核，干燥。本品照上述[含量测定]项下的方法测定，含金樱子多糖以葡萄糖（C6H12O6）计，不得少于25.0％。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-ie0v5lm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-ie0v5lm","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】酸、甘、涩，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-de9fc48","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-de9fc48","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肾、膀胱、大肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-ruyaez6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-ruyaez6","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】固精缩尿，涩肠止泻。用于遗精滑精，遗尿尿频，崩漏带下，久泻久痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-awvbkk3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-awvbkk3","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】6～12g。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-ys9ziz9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-ys9ziz9","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置通风干燥处，防蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-yx44uye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-yx44uye","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-gnr7jio","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-gnr7jio","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"金樱子《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-wgf2e6o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-wgf2e6o","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《雷公炮炙论》"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-fat1qn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-fat1qn0","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】JīnYīnɡZǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-nckmzka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-nckmzka","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】刺榆子（《蜀本草》），刺梨子（《开宝本草》），金罂子（《梦溪笔淡》），山石榴（《奇效良方》），山鸡头子（《纲目》），糖莺子（《生草药性备要》），棠球、糖罐（《植物名实图考长编》），糖果（《分类草药性》），黄刺果（《中药形性经验鉴别法》），蜂糖罐、槟榔果（《贵州民间方药集》），金壶瓶（《浙江中药手册》），野石榴、糖橘子（《江苏植药志》），小石榴（《四川武隆药植图志》），黄茶瓶、藤勾子、螳螂果、糖刺果（《广西中药志》），灯笼果（《药材学》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-1lm1jm8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-1lm1jm8","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为蔷薇科植物金樱子的果实。10～11月间，果实红熟时采摘，晒干，除去毛刺。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-6ph8sdh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-6ph8sdh","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-zi45g3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-zi45g3h","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"金樱子，又名：白玉带、下山虎、刺藤棘、刺郎子树、螳螂子树、三叶勒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-w6v45wc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-w6v45wc","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"常绿攀援灌木，高达5米。茎红褐色，有倒钩状皮刺。三出复叶互生；小叶革质，椭圆状卵圆形至卵圆状披针形，侧生小叶较小，叶柄和小叶下面中脉上无刺或有疏刺；叶柄长1～2厘米，有褐色腺点细刺；托叶中部以下与叶柄合生，其分离部线状披针形。花单生于侧枝顶端，直径5～8厘米；花梗粗壮，长达3厘米，有直刺；花托膨大，有细刺；萼片5，卵状披针形，有些顶端扩大成叶状，被腺毛；花瓣5；雄蕊多数，花药丁字形着生；雌蕊具多数心皮，离生，被绒毛，花柱线形，柱头圆形。成熟花托红色，球形或倒卵形，有直刺，顶端有长宿存萼，内含骨质瘦果多颗。花期5月。果期9～10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-b75dz3n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-b75dz3n","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】生长于荒废山野多石地方。分布华中、华南、华东及四川、贵州等地。主产于广东、湖南、浙江、江西等地。此外，江苏、安徽、广西、福建、四川等地亦产。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-hab892j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-hab892j","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】干燥果实呈倒卵形，略似花瓶，长约3厘米，直径1～2厘米。外皮红黄色或红棕色，上端宿存花萼如盘状，下端渐尖。全体有突起的棕色小点，系毛刺脱落后的残痕，触之刺手。质坚硬，切开观察，肉厚约1.5毫米，内壁附有淡黄色绒毛，有光泽，内有多数淡黄色坚硬的核。无臭，味甘微酸涩。以个大、色红黄、去净毛刺者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-7qkxytj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-7qkxytj","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-gvui3c4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-gvui3c4","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"金樱子（果实）含柠檬酸、苹果酸，鞣质、树脂、维生素C，含皂甙17.12％；另含丰富的糖类，其中有还原糖60％（果糖33％），蔗糖1.9％，以及少量淀粉。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-ab928z7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-ab928z7","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"美蔷薇果实含有糖分。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-sdnltjl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-sdnltjl","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-cw6e4t8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-cw6e4t8","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①对实验性动脉粥样硬化的作用"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-mh1rh6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-mh1rh6q","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"家兔喂食胆甾醇并加适量甲基硫氧嘧啶以产生实验性动脉粥样硬化，用金樱子（品种不详）治疗两周和三周，血清胆甾醇分别降低12.5％和18.67％，β-脂蛋白于给药3周后亦有明显下降。肝脏与心脏的脂肪沉着均较对照组轻微。粥样化程度也很轻微，对照组则十分严重。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-pllwd7q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-pllwd7q","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②抗菌作用"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-zkjyljm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-zkjyljm","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"金樱子含鞣质，用平碟法作抑菌试验，25％根煎剂对金黄色葡萄球菌、大肠杆菌有很高的抑菌作用，对绿脓杆菌也有效。鸡胚试验证明，金樱子煎剂对流感病毒PR株抑制作用很强，而且对亚洲甲型57-4株、乙型Lee株、丙型1233株和丁型仙台株也有作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-1sq5d81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-1sq5d81","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】拣去杂质，切两瓣，用水稍洗泡，捞出，闷润后除去残留毛刺，挖净毛、核，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-ebbech8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-ebbech8","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-vr3vh1w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-vr3vh1w","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸涩，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-2zwytvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-2zwytvu","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《开宝本草》：\"味酸涩，平温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-opqbsc2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-opqbsc2","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草正》：\"味涩，性平，生者酸涩，熟者甘涩。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-mefkrp2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-mefkrp2","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-gqncvff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-gqncvff","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入肾、膀胱、大肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-gvko8w5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-gvko8w5","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《滇南本草》：\"入脾、肾二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-z8hudvi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-z8hudvi","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入脾、肺、肾三经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-euaa800","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-euaa800","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草经巯》：\"入足阳明、手阳明，兼入足少阴经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-r9rl7m7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-r9rl7m7","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草汇言》：\"入足太阳、少阴，手阳明经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-31z8707","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-31z8707","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-bom1ye0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-bom1ye0","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"固精涩肠，缩尿止泻。治滑精，遗尿，小便频数，脾虚泻痢，肺虚喘咳，自汗盗汗，崩漏带下。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-76732he","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-76732he","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"止遗泄。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-pzilxuq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-pzilxuq","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《蜀本草》：\"治脾泄下痢，止小便利，涩精气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-p53mrkw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-p53mrkw","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《滇南本草》：\"治日久下痢，血崩带下，涩精遗泄。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-mlmxgpd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-mlmxgpd","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草正》：\"止吐血，衄血，生津液，收虚汗，敛虚火，益精髓，壮筋骨，补五藏，养血气，平咳嗽，定喘急，疗怔仲惊悸，止脾泄血痢及小水不禁。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-j1rbadj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-j1rbadj","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《南宁市药物志》：\"熬膏治火伤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-6ghuhz7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-6ghuhz7","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，1.5～3钱；或入丸、散或熬膏。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-roavblt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-roavblt","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-q3c5fos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-q3c5fos","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有实火、邪热者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-0uh9jh3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-0uh9jh3","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《医学入门》：\"中寒有痞者禁服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-pc6cl68","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-pc6cl68","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"泄泻由于火热暴注者不宜用；小便不禁及精气滑脱因于阴虚火炽而得者，不宜用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-ovm9r19","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-ovm9r19","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-s7t2m77","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-s7t2m77","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治梦遗，精不固：金樱子十斤，剖开去子毛，于木臼内杵碎。水二升，煎成膏子服。（《明医指掌》金樱子膏）"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-m1dl0w4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-m1dl0w4","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治小便频数，多尿小便不禁：金樱子（去净外刺和内瓤）和猪小肚一个。水煮服。（《泉州本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-hdjil66","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-hdjil66","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治男子下消、滑精，女子白带：金樱子去毛、核一两。水煎服，或和猪膀胱，或和冰糖炖服。（《闽东本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-zi05j20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-zi05j20","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治白浊：金樱子（去子洗净捣碎，入瓶中蒸令热，用汤淋之，取汁慢火成膏）、芡实肉（研为粉）各等分。上以前膏同酒糊和芡粉为丸，如梧桐子大.每服三十丸，酒吞，食前服。一方用妇人乳汁丸为妙。一方盐汤下。（《仁存堂经验方》水陆二仙丹）"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-i85qm9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-i85qm9j","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治脾泄下利，止小便利，涩精气：金樱子，经霜后以竹夹子摘取，擘为两爿，去其子，以水淘洗过，烂捣，入大锅以水煎，不得绝火，煎约水耗半，取出澄滤过，仍重煎似稀饧。每服取一匙，用暖酒一盏，调服。（《寿亲养老新书》金樱子煎）"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-negonsl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-negonsl","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治久虚泄泻下痢：金樱子（去外刺和内瓤）一两，党参三钱。水煎服。（《泉州本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-0dowlik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-0dowlik","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治久痢脱肛：金樱子（去刺、仁）一两，鸡蛋一枚炖服。（《闽东本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-3p80wer","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-3p80wer","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治阴挺：金樱果（去内毛和种子）一两。水煎服。（《闽东本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-pyoo2hn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-pyoo2hn","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨补血：金樱子（干了，擦刺令净，捶碎去子，切焙）、缩砂一半。蜜丸梧子大。空心，酒或盐汤下五十丸。（《朱氏集验医方》金樱子丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-mvuru2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-mvuru2x","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-5wvvoh1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-5wvvoh1","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《梦溪笔谈》：\"金罂子，止遗泄，取其温且涩也，世之用金罂者，待其红熟时，取汁熬膏用之，大误也，红则味甘，熬膏则全断涩味，都失本性。今当取半黄时采，干捣末用之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-4tkf43q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-4tkf43q","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草衍义补遗》：\"经络隧道，以通畅为和平，昧者取涩性为快，遂（以金樱子）熬为煎，食之自不作靖，咎将谁执。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-gu7bwtr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-gu7bwtr","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"金樱子，无故而服之，以取快欲，则不可；若精气不固者服之，何咎之有。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-896x5w7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-896x5w7","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草经疏》：\"《十剂》云，涩可去脱。脾虚滑泄不禁，非涩剂无以固之。膀胱虚寒则小便不禁，肾与膀胱为表里，肾虚则精滑，时从小便出，此药（金樱子）气温，味酸涩，入三经而收敛虚脱之气，故能主诸证也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-42vakyl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-42vakyl","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草新编》：\"金樱子，世人竞采以涩精，谁知精滑非止涩之药可止也。遗精梦遗之症，皆尿窍闭而精窍开，不兼用利水之药以开尿窍，而仅用涩精之味以固精门，故愈涩而愈遗也。所以用金樱子，必须兼用芡实、山药、莲子、薏仁之类，不单止遗精而精滑反涩，用涩于利之中，用补于遗之内，此用药之秘，而实知药之深也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-nr02tnv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-nr02tnv","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】治疗子宫脱垂:取金樱子干品水煎两次，去渣浓缩，使每500毫升含生药相当于1市斤。每日120毫升，早晚分服。连服3天为一疗程，间隔3天，再连服3天为第二疗程。治疗203例，痊愈16例，好转138例，有效率为76％。治程中部分有便秘、腹痛、小腹痛、下腹部胀感等，个别发生咳嗽。经初步观察，对年青、脱垂程度较轻、没有白带的患者疗效较好。而对脱垂程度严重、年龄大的患者，只能作为一种辅助治疗。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-bi0684y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-bi0684y","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-0h1gdqt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-0h1gdqt","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"除上述正品外，尚有几种同属植物的果实，在少数地区作金樱子使用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-z2khvka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-z2khvka","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①美蔷薇及扁刺蔷薇，使用于河北、山西。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-yd96i3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-yd96i3j","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②大花香蔷薇，使用于云南。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-q3khnbu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-q3khnbu","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③大叶蔷薇，使用于西藏。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-edyiqlz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-edyiqlz","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-g21v0is","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-g21v0is","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"金樱子《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-vaqgpzz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-vaqgpzz","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-bukh50f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-bukh50f","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出自《雷公炮灸论》。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-y0ljotm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-y0ljotm","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草图经》》：金樱子，今南中州郡多有，而以江西、剑南、岭外者为胜。丛生郊野中，大类蔷薇，有刺，四月开白花，夏秋结实，亦有刺，黄赤色，形似小石榴。十一月、十二月采。江南、蜀中人熬作煎，酒服云补，治有殊效。宜州所供，云《本草》谓之营实，其注称曰，白花者善，即此也。今校诸郡所述，与营实殊别也。洪州、昌州皆能煮其子作煎，寄至都下，服食家用和鸡头实作水陆丹，益气补真甚佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-vtxcyus","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-vtxcyus","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】JīnYīnɡZǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-1a7eu5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-1a7eu5t","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】CherokeeRoseFruit,FruitofCherokeeRose"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-e476q71","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-e476q71","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】刺榆子、刺梨子、金罂子、山石榴、山鸡头子、糖莺子、糖罐、糖果、蜂糖罐、槟榔果、金壶瓶、糖橘子、黄茶瓶、藤勾子、螳螂果、糖刺果、灯笼果、刺橄榄、灯笼果、刺兰棵子"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-o95p79d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-o95p79d","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-2mctlc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-2mctlc8","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为蔷薇科植物金樱子的果实。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-2p1ymma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-2p1ymma","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：RosalaevigataMichx."}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-mwfhu2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-mwfhu2g","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：10-11月间，果实红熟时采摘，除去毛刺，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-v4k2twk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-v4k2twk","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】金樱子常绿攀援灌木，高达5m。茎无毛，有钩状皮刺和刺毛。羽状复叶，叶柄和叶轴具小皮刺和刺毛；托叶披针形，与叶柄分离，早落。小叶革质，通常3，稀5，椭圆状卵形或披针状卵形，长2.5-7cm，宽1.5-4.5cm，先端急尖或渐尖，基部近圆形，边缘具细齿状锯齿，无毛，有光泽。花单生于侧枝顶端，花梗和萼筒外面均密被刺毛；萼片5；花瓣5；白色直径5-9cm；雄蕊多数，心皮多数，柱头聚生于花托口。果实倒卵形，长2-4cm，紫褐色，外面密被刺毛。花期4-6月，果期7-11月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-t8g3dg2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-t8g3dg2","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-whwnilw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-whwnilw","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于海拔100-1600m的向阳的山野、田边、溪畔灌木丛中。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-4b5u713","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-4b5u713","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于陕西、江苏、安徽、浙江、江西、福建、台湾、河南、湖北、湖南、广东、海南、广西、四川、贵州、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-zc5wgqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-zc5wgqc","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-1mixxae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-1mixxae","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生物学特性喜温暖干燥的气候。以排水良好、疏松、肥沃的砂质壤土为宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-ysptzrs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-ysptzrs","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术用种子和扦插繁殖。以扦插繁殖为主。种子繁殖：冬季用新鲜的种子播种，按30cm行距开浅沟，种子均匀撒入沟里，覆土1.5cm，每1h㎡播种量30-37.5kg。第2年春季出苗，出苗2-3年后，春季移栽。扦插繁殖：在春季发芽前，选健壮的母株，剪取1-2年生枝条作为插条，长12-15cm，斜插于砂床中，压紧，浇水，保持经常湿润，盖以芦帘遮荫。约经2月左右即可生根发芽。至翌年2-3月或9-10月间移植。按行、株距各40-60cm开穴，每穴栽种1株，覆土压实，浇水。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-1nvwyd4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-1nvwyd4","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理苗床内需浇水保持经常湿润，注意遮荫。移植后须浇水，成活后还需浇水2-3次。每年松土、除草3-4次，并结合培土。春、秋各施肥1-2次。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-meo7y6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-meo7y6t","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-kzbvs7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-kzbvs7j","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别本品为花托发育而成的假果，呈倒卵形，长2-3．5cm，直径1-2cm。表面黄红色至棕红色，略具光泽，有多数刺状刚毛脱落后的残基形成棕色小突起；无端宿存花萼呈盘状，其中央稍隆起，有黄色花柱基；基部渐细，有残留果柄。质坚硬，纵切后可见花萼筒壁厚1-2mm，内壁密生谈黄色有光泽的绒毛，瘦果数十粒，扁纺锤形，长约7mm，淡黄棕色，木质，外被淡黄色绒毛。气微，味甘、微涩。以个大、色红黄、有光泽、去净毛刺者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-hyuv1y7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-hyuv1y7","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别花托壁横切面：外表皮细胞类方形或略径向延长，外壁及侧壁增厚，角质化；表皮上的刺痕纵切面细胞径向延长。皮层薄壁细胞壁稍厚，纹孔明显，含油滴，并含橙黄色物，有的含草酸钙方晶及簇晶；纤维束散列于近皮层外侧；维管束多存在于皮层中部及内侧，外韧型，韧皮部外侧有纤维束，导管散在或呈放射状排列。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-xpgsryy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-xpgsryy","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内表皮细胞长方形，内壁增厚，角质化；有木化的非腺毛或其残基。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-ybylgl6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-ybylgl6","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"花托粉末特征：淡肉红色。①非腺毛互至多细胞，长505-1836μm，直径16-31μm，壁木化或微木化，表面常有略弯曲的斜条纹，胞腔内含黄棕色物。②表皮细胞多角形，壁厚，内含黄棕色物。③草酸钙方晶多见，长方形或不规则形，直径16-39μm；簇晶少见，直径27-66μm。④螺纹、网纹、环纹及具缘纹孔导管直径8-20μm。⑤薄壁细胞多角形，木化，具纹孔，含黄棕色物。③纤维梭形或条形，黄色，长至1071μm，直径16-20μm，壁木化。⑦树脂块不规则形，黄棕色，半透明。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-9xdwqz8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-9xdwqz8","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】果实含枸椽酸（citricacid），苹果酸（malicacid）。果皮含多种水解型鞣质：金樱子鞣质（laevigatin）A、B、C、D、E、F、G，仙鹤草素（agrimoniin），前矢车菊素（procyanidin）B-3，他榆素（sanguiin）H-4，长梗马兜铃素（pedunculagin），蛇含鞣质（Potentillin），仙鹤草酸（agrimonicacid）A和B。此外，地上部分还分离到多种三萜化合物：常春藤皂甙元（hederagenin），熊果酸（ursolicacid），齐墩果酸（oleanolicacid），2a-羟基熊果酸甲酯（methyl2a-ydroxyursolate），2a-甲氧基熊果酸甲酯（methyl2a-methoxyursolate），委陵菜酸甲酯（methyltormentate），11a-羟基委陵莱酸甲酯（methyl11a-hydroxytormentate），野鸦椿酸甲酯（methyleuscaphate），委陵菜酸-β-D-吡喃葡萄糖酯甙(tormenticacidβ-D-glucopyranosylester，委陵菜酸-6-甲氧基-β-D-吡喃葡萄糖酯甙（tormenticacid-6-methoxy-β-D-glucopyranosylester），野鸦椿酸-β-D-葡萄糖酯甙（euscaphicacid-β-D-glucoPyranosylester），甲基-β-D-吡喃葡萄糖甙（methyl-β-D-glucopyranoside），谷甾醇-β-D-吡喃葡萄糖甙（sitosteryl-β-D-glucopyranoside），7-氧谷甾醇醉-β-D-吡喃葡萄糖甙(7-oxysitosteryl-β-D-glucoPyranoside），7-羟基谷甾醇-3-O-β-D-吡喃葡萄糖甙（7-hydroxysitosteryl-3-O-β-D-glucopyranoside），豆甾-3a，5a-二醇-3-O-β-D-吡喃葡萄糖甙（stigmasta-3a，5a-diol-3-O-β-D-glucopyranoside）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-8pl2tv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-8pl2tv5","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-wn0haa8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-wn0haa8","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1．对泌尿系统的影响金樱子水提物6g/kg灌胃，能使腹下神经制备尿频模型大鼠排尿次数减少，排尿间隔时间延长，每次排尿增多。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-x3472tg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-x3472tg","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2．对平滑肌的作用金樱子水提取物能抑制家兔离体空肠平滑肌的自主收缩，拮抗乙酰胆碱、氯化钡引起的家兔空肠平滑肌、大鼠离体膀胱平滑肌的痉挛性收缩，拮抗去甲肾上腺素引起的家兔离体胸主动脉条收缩反应，对上述3种平滑肌的抑制作用均呈显着性的量效关系。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-criyc9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-criyc9z","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3．对实验性动脉粥样硬化的作用家兔喂食胆甾醇并加适量甲基硫氧嘧啶以产生实验性动脉粥样硬化，用金樱子治疗2星期和3星期，血清胆甾醇分别降低12．5%和18．67%，-脂蛋白于给药3星期后亦有明显下降。肝脏与心脏的脂肪沉着均较对照组轻微。粥样硬化程度也很轻微，对照组则十分严重。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-qqdljwo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-qqdljwo","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4．抗病原体作用金樱子含鞣质，用平碟法作抑菌试验，25%根煎剂对金黄色葡萄球菌、大肠杆菌有很高的抑菌作用，对绿脓杆菌也有效。鸡胚试验证明，金樱子煎剂对流感病毒PR/8株抑制作用很强，而且对亚洲甲型57－4株、乙型Lee株、丙型1233株和丁型仙台株也有作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-tj208el","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-tj208el","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】(1）取本品lg加水10ml，水浴加热20min放冷，滤过。取滤液2ml加新配制的碱性酒石酸铜试剂1ml，在沸水浴中加热5min产生红色氧化亚铜沉淀。（检查糖类）（2）取（1）项下滤液2ml，置具塞试管中，用力振摇1min，生成大量蜂窝状泡沫，放置10min，泡沫无明显消失。（检查皂甙）"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-0m14ymm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-0m14ymm","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】拣去杂质，切两瓣，用水稍洗泡，捞出，闷润后除去残留毛刺，挖净毛、核，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-46zuils","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-46zuils","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】酸涩；平；无毒"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-mmpphaz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-mmpphaz","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肾；膀胱；大肠；脾；肺经"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-l5uj76u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-l5uj76u","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】固精，缩尿，涩肠，止带。主滑精；滑精；遗尿；尿频；久泻；久痢；白浊；白带；崩漏；脱肛；子宫下垂"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-eai783u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-eai783u","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，9-15g；或入丸、散，或熬膏。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-rptwal6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-rptwal6","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-noug2ni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-noug2ni","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.有实火、邪热者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-ma6fn1b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-ma6fn1b","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《医学入门》：中寒有痞者禁服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-7oksg73","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-7oksg73","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草经疏》：泄泻由于火热暴注者不宜用；小便不禁及精气滑脱因于阴虚火炽而得者，不宜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-5eh617y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-5eh617y","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】水陆二仙丹《洪氏验方》；金樱子膏《明医指掌》；金樱子煎《寿亲养老新书》"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-76ngw5g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-76ngw5g","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-0k463fk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-0k463fk","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《梦溪笔谈》：金罂子，止遗泄，取其温且涩也，世之用金罂者，待其红熟时，取汁熬膏用之，大误也，红则味甘，熬膏则全断涩味，都失本性。今当取半黄时采，干捣末用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-pu4413x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-pu4413x","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草衍义补遗》：经络隧道，以通畅为和平，昧者取涩性为快，遂（以金樱子）熬为煎，食之自不作靖，咎将谁执。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-nyq0vj8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-nyq0vj8","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草纲目》金樱子，无故而服之，以取快欲，则不可；若精气不固者服之，何咎之有。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-v658j06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-v658j06","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草经疏》：《十剂》云，涩可去脱。脾虚滑泄不禁，非涩剂无以固之。膀胱虚寒则小便不禁，肾与膀胱为表里，肾虚则精滑，时从小便出，止药（金樱子）气温，味酸涩，入三经而收敛虚脱之气，故能主诸证也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-9k3l0f9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-9k3l0f9","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草新编》：金樱子，世人竞采以涩精，谁知精滑非止涩之药可止也。遗精梦遗之症，皆尿窍闭而精窍开，不兼用利水之药以开尿窍，而仅用涩精之味以固精门，故愈涩而愈遗也。所以用金樱子，必须兼用芡实、山药、莲子、薏仁之类，不单止遗精而精滑反涩，用涩于利之中，用补于遗之内，此用药之秘，而实知药之深也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-g5derzu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-g5derzu","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《名医别录》：止遗泄。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-tjg1yr9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-tjg1yr9","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《蜀本草》：治脾泄下痢，止小便利，涩精气。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-9hzj361","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-9hzj361","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《滇南本草》：治日久下痢，血崩带下，涩精遗泄。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-c5zszej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-c5zszej","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《本草正》：止吐血，衄血，生津液，收虚汗，敛虚火，益精髓，壮筋骨，补五藏，养血气，平咳嗽，定喘急，疗怔忡惊悸，止脾泄血痢及小水不禁。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-q0dfqau","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-q0dfqau","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《南宁市药物志》：熬膏治火伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240902175406-mw9ufna","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175406-mw9ufna","updated":"20240902175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902175407-8wzoomc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902175407-8wzoomc","updated":"20240902175434"}},{"ID":"20240902175408-muva9uf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902175408-muva9uf","updated":"20240902175434"}}]}